{
  "id": "496",
  "title": "Ben’s Diary – Two Types of “Can”",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2018-03-29",
  "synopsis": "Pay attention to the subtle difference in meaning between the two words that both mean “can”.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/694/a4b71d099b64a8314e4bb20040aca3b5b73c6929.mp3?1589791869",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 4: Trouble in Paradise",
    "chapter": 21,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "本的日记—“会”和“能”\n\n    今天我们想开车去故宫玩。丽丽在上课，不能来。小雨不会开车。露西会开车，但是她喝酒了，不能开车。我也会开车，但是我只能在美国开车，不能在中国开车。后来，我们是坐公共汽车去的故宫。",
    "traditional": "本的日記—“會”和“能”\n\n    今天我們想開車去故宮玩。麗麗在上課，不能來。小雨不會開車。露西會開車，但是她喝酒了，不能開車。我也會開車，但是我只能在美國開車，不能在中國開車。後來，我們是坐公共汽車去的故宮。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben’s Diary – Two Types of “Can”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天我们想开车去故宫玩。",
      "traditional": "今天我們想開車去故宮玩。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān wǒ men xiǎng kāi chē qù gù gōng wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "丽丽在上课，不能来。",
      "traditional": "麗麗在上課，不能來。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zài shàng kè bù néng lái",
      "english": "Today we wanted to drive to the Forbidden City."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨不会开车。",
      "traditional": "小雨不會開車。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ bú huì kāi chē",
      "english": "Lili was attending class, and couldn’t come."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "露西会开车，但是她喝酒了，不能开车。",
      "traditional": "露西會開車，但是她喝酒了，不能開車。",
      "pinyin": "lù xī huì kāi chē dàn shì tā hē jiǔ le bù néng kāi chē",
      "english": "Little Yu can’t drive."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "我也会开车，但是我只能在美国开车，不能在中国开车。",
      "traditional": "我也會開車，但是我只能在美國開車，不能在中國開車。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yě huì kāi chē dàn shì wǒ zhǐ néng zài měi guó kāi chē bù néng zài zhōng guó kāi chē",
      "english": "Lucy knows how to drive, but she had drunk alcohol so she couldn’t drive."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "后来，我们是坐公共汽车去的故宫。",
      "traditional": "後來，我們是坐公共汽車去的故宮。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái wǒ men shì zuò gōng gòng qì chē qù de gù gōng",
      "english": "I also know how to drive, but I can only drive in the US, and not in China."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In the end, we ended up taking the bus to the Forbidden City."
    }
  ],
